Hello Railfans!

Over the weekend we received a lot of feedback from you regarding bugs and suggestions in the game.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33426656/dec11591ef02ab41d2158f13875e172c14a1f6da.png


Update 1.0.0.2v

Our changes:
- Correction for lvl 7 on loading;
- Repair of keys assigned to the keyboard;
- Added option to change the brightness;
- Fixed turntable;
- FXAA for tablet;
Level 1:
- Fixed entrance door to the station;
- The appearance of garbage bags has been fixed;


Changes thanks to community help:
- Fixes in the game loading system;
- Corrections in linearity at lvl 6;
- Backlighting for some rubbish;
- Illumination of train windows;
- Improving some translations;
- Adding a list of items to put up while browsing the store;
Level 2:
- Fixed "The basement light";
- Fixed "Windows";
- Fixed "Bathroom and basement door"
- Fixed "Leaky walls in the bathroom"

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33426656/3275740acc70c627275e89ee73f2cec9575f4e27.png


Best regards
Train Station Renovation team

https://store.steampowered.com/app/914010/Train_Station_Renovation/

Hello Railfans!

We collected feedback from you on the first beta tests and decided to make some corrections.

Changes that will be added on November 20:

 Improved stability and performance of the game; 
 New, better quality 3d models;
 Improved UI;
 Improved Main Menu;
 Improved Tutorial;
 Bug Fixes.


Best regards
Train Station Renovation team

